Add a new migration after the database is running:

```bash
python -m sec_filings.db.bootstrap
alembic revision -m "describe_your_change" --autogenerate
# inspect alembic/versions/* then:
alembic upgrade head
```

The first revision (`001_initial_sec_pgvector`) enables `vector`, creates companies/filings/chunks/portfolios, and adds an HNSW index on `filing_chunks.embedding`.
